{"name": "WATERPUNK", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"190\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/92b13808b743997bee938daa7349f5e4.avif?t=1785598763\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A roguelite action game set in a post-apocalyptic water world. Shape your strategy by choosing which abilities shine by day and which awaken at night.<br/>Get ready for fast-paced combat, procedural generation, permadeath, and meta-progression.<br/>You play as a volunteer sent to the surface in search of vital resources. Explore rust-covered platforms, fight hostile machines, collect loot, and upgrade your skills. Maybe your run will be the one that changes everything - and gives humanity a second chance. <br/> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High-Intensity Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are deadly and unforgiving. You'll need precise aim and constant movement to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/08cd608b25d0f6e22fbd62571d147d5c.poster.avif?t=1785598763\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/08cd608b25d0f6e22fbd62571d147d5c.webm?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/08cd608b25d0f6e22fbd62571d147d5c.mp4?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some perks only work during the day, others - only at night. Plan your build wisely as time in the game moves forward relentlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/0f8e97074262c34c1e92b10d78b52218.poster.avif?t=1785598763\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/0f8e97074262c34c1e92b10d78b52218.webm?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/0f8e97074262c34c1e92b10d78b52218.mp4?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Wide Arsenal of Weapons and Gadgets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match dozens of weapons and active items to handle any threat that comes your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/4c1ba3b3bbb3a53b8365f1423d9020e2.poster.avif?t=1785598763\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/4c1ba3b3bbb3a53b8365f1423d9020e2.webm?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/4c1ba3b3bbb3a53b8365f1423d9020e2.mp4?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedural Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels, enemies, and loot are generated from scratch each time - no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/3834da8050c5991a10319b1fc816fd5d.poster.avif?t=1785598763\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/3834da8050c5991a10319b1fc816fd5d.webm?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/3834da8050c5991a10319b1fc816fd5d.mp4?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meta-Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is not the end. Upgrade your starting base to improve your chances in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/cd6b07abea8ec6586f474825dac8b854.poster.avif?t=1785598763\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/cd6b07abea8ec6586f474825dac8b854.webm?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/extras/cd6b07abea8ec6586f474825dac8b854.mp4?t=1785598763\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-Apocalyptic Waterworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Civilization fell in a war against soulless machines. Cities are submerged, and the last survivors hide in underwater bunkers, venturing to the surface only in search of resources.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A roguelite action game inspired by the legendary Enter the Gungeon and Nuclear Throne, set in a post-apocalyptic aquatic world. Shape your strategy by choosing which abilities shine by day and which awaken at night.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859430/30dea10a2f4dce5ea3b7ead33ca56ee5d9327970/header.jpg?t=1785598763", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Top-Down Shooter", "Roguelite", "Tw